		    value      	FALSE))
	    quid       	"37BC91B00060"
	    documentation 	
|Interface for performing a Step to find a Solution (e.g. Root of Function f)
| * 
| * Design Decisions:
| * This Class is for Determining an x Value that fulfills a certain Criterion,
| * like with Finding Roots or Minima. 
| * For iterated stepping along a Function (Integration etc.) use absStepper.
| * 
| * Inheriting Classes are:
| * FalsiStep
| * FixPtStep
| * NewtonStep/NewtonStep2 	
| * 
| * absStepper is not inherited, since it uses intDGL instead of intFunction
| * and also different Variable Names.
| * No use in defining an abstract Super Class just for xl, yl, dx.  
	    
	    realized_interfaces 	(list realize_rel_list
		(object Realize_Relationship
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD39A102CC"
		    supplier   	"Logical View::Ring::intRefiner"
		    quidu      	"37BC91B0005D"))
	    operations 	(list Operations
		(object Operation "Init"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD39A60306"
		    documentation 	
|Initializing the Iteration 
|	 * by giving the Function and a Starting Point.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "x_"
			    type       	"IntegrityRing")
			(object Parameter "f_"
			    type       	"intFunction"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "absRefiner"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD39A60312"
		    documentation 	
|Empty Constructor.	 
		    
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "absRefiner"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD39A60313"
		    documentation 	
|Initializing Constructor for Iteration 
|	 * by giving the Function and a Starting Point.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "x_"
			    type       	"IntegrityRing")
			(object Parameter "f_"
			    type       	"intFunction"))
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
